      "body": "### Pre-flight Checks\n- [x] I have searched existing issues and this is not a duplicate\n- [x] I understand this issue needs status:approved before a PR can be opened\n\n### Feature Summary\nLast mandatory HermesProvider child: show Hermes session activity in Cockpit (wide/compact/minimal) as **observe-only** overlay. No control, no service start, no MCP.\n\nDepends on Slice 02 merged to tracker [#176](https://github.com/Kal-elSam/harness/pull/176) @ `1b88b44`.\n\n### Motivation\nSlice 02 loads `signals.hermes.activity` into the companion snapshot, but Cockpit overlay still only shows Gentle/Graphify/Engram. Operators need a fail-soft Hermes summary without leaving Overview.\n\n### Proposed Solution\n- Extend companion overlay formatting with layout-aware Hermes lines from `companion.signals.hermes.activity`\n- States degrade opaquely (`available|partial|unavailable|incompatible|error`)\n- Wide may show a few session titles (no ids / no control actions); compact/minimal stay summary-only\n- Never start/stop Hermes, never open chat, never mutate sessions\n- Absent Hermes must not block Cockpit\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Child PR ≤400 changed lines targeting `feat/kairo-hermes-provider`\n- [ ] wide/compact/minimal validated; fail-soft when activity missing/error\n- [ ] No governance coupling / no control affordances\n- [ ] CI Node 20/22/24 + RDD on exact tip SHA\n- [ ] Squash only into tracker #176 after human gate\n\n### Additional Context\nTracker [#174](https://github.com/Kal-elSam/harness/issues/174). Slice 04 MCP remains deferred.",
